{"id":554,"gn":"Pokémon Daruma","ft":["Quand le feu brûle dans son corps, il est tout excité et court partout. Quand le feu s’apaise, il s’endort.","Les gens d’autrefois avaient l’habitude de mettre ses crottes brûlantes sous leurs vêtements pour se réchauffer.","Quand il dort, ses pattes se rétractent et les flammes qui brûlent à 600 °C dans son corps s’apaisent.","La flamme qui brûle dans son corps est sa source d’énergie. Si le feu s’affaiblit, il s’endort sur-le-champ.","On a beau le pousser ou le tirer, quand il dort, rien ne le fait vaciller. Cette qualité lui a valu de devenir un emblème pour les porte-bonheurs."],"fv":{"17":0,"18":1,"23":1,"24":2,"25":1,"26":2,"33":3,"34":4},"tt":["Quand il dort, il tire ses membres dans son corps et son feu interne descend à 1100° F."],"tv":{"21":0,"22":0},"gr":4,"cr":120,"hc":20,"bh":70,"eg":["Terrestre"],"gw":"medium-slow","gm":{"swcrown":[0,103],"sw":[0,367,2,103],"b2w2":[0,102],"bw":[0,60]},"f":{"554":{"n":"Darumarond","t":["fire"],"s":[70,90,45,15,45,50],"h":0.6,"w":37.5,"a":[[55,0],[39,1]],"av":["swcrown","sw","b2w2","bw"],"hi":[[129,50,[17,18,21,22]]],"ls":[{"l":[[52,1],[33,1],[269,4],[44,8],[510,12],[526,16],[424,20],[29,24],[7,28],[253,32],[187,36],[394,40],[37,44],[276,48]],"m":[5,7,25,53,76,83,91,116,126,156,157,164,168,173,182,203,213,214,227,241,253,257,261,263,269,276,280,315,317,360,369,374,394,424,428,447,496,526],"e":[36,172,264,281,326,359]},{"l":[[33,1],[205,3],[510,6],[99,9],[424,11],[29,14],[253,17],[263,19],[7,22],[526,25],[37,27],[187,30],[394,33],[269,35],[276,39],[315,42]],"m":[46,53,70,76,91,92,104,126,156,157,164,168,182,207,213,216,218,237,241,249,261,263,269,280,315,317,360,369,374,447,488,496,510,526],"e":[36,116,172,203,214,227,264,281,359],"t":[7,173,214,253,257,276,283,428]},{"l":[[33,1],[205,3],[510,6],[99,9],[424,11],[29,14],[253,17],[263,19],[7,22],[526,25],[37,27],[187,30],[394,33],[269,35],[276,39],[315,42]],"m":[46,53,70,76,91,92,104,126,156,157,164,168,182,207,213,216,218,237,241,249,